Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:02.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,it's sort of like a very um dynamic market.\N这有点像一个非常动态的市场。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.12,0:00:07.21,Sub,,0,0,0,,And then and then you've got like Microsoft and Google are starting to deploy their CPUs in volumes.\N然后，微软和谷歌也开始大规模部署他们的CPU了。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.26,0:00:14.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,Um ARM is going to launch a CPU in like a few weeks uh that Meta is going to adopt and a few others are going to adopt um like Cloudflare.\N嗯，Arm 几周后将推出一款 CPU，Meta 将采用，\N还有像 Cloudflare 这样的公司也会采用。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.64,0:00:19.70,Sub,,0,0,0,,And so there's going to be a lot more proliferation like Arm standalone rather than like Arm licensing the IP to someone.\N因此会出现更多 Arm 独立芯片，而不是 Arm 把 IP 授权给别人。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.75,0:00:26.70,Sub,,0,0,0,,So there's a lot more um diversification in the market um which which happens when there's a gold rush, right?\N所以市场上有更多的多样化，这在出现淘金热时就会发生，对吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.75,0:00:33.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,And then we'll see what actually is the best quality and is left standing as the sort of supply demand gap get closes.\N随后我们将看到，当供需差距逐渐缩小后，究竟哪种质量的产品能够脱颖而出，保持领先。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.96,0:00:34.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,Yeah.\N嗯。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.40,0:00:40.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,But it seems that supply and demand will still grow like at least what I see like one the RL and it it seems like RL is mostly done,\N但看起来供需仍会继续增长。至少从我看到的情况，强化学习大多是在后训练阶段完成，
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.60,0:00:49.01,Sub,,0,0,0,,you know, they do post trading on RL, but we have now vendors and companies that are pitching and creating services that do RL in real time.\N你知道，他们确实会用强化学习做后训练，但现在已有供应商在提供实时强化学习服务。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.06,0:00:54.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,And since you have like some agents you have some SaaS that's an agentic in the background and then\N而且因为你们有一些智能体，有些 SaaS 在后台以代理式方式运行。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.92,0:01:00.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,it will do RL at the end of the day basically to like learn against what it has done.\N说到底，它最终会进行强化学习，以根据自身行为进行学习。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.41,0:01:01.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,And so that grows.\N于是它不断增长。
